329 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/ActualText(Rather than being just a theory, SMC is a complete trading methodology with its unique terminologies and concepts. Let\220s take a closer look at some of SMC\220s concepts and trading techniques.)/K[3]/Pg 32 0 R/S/P>>
