335 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/ActualText(This concept is fundamental to understanding SMC. Essentially, order blocks refer to a market condition when central banks, governments, and large financial institutions accumulate or distribute large quantities of an asset through several big orders. They do so to be able to purchase the asset without creating panic and high volatility in the market.)/K[5]/Pg 32 0 R/S/P>>
endobj

