366 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/ActualText(These are order blocks that fail to hold the price level in a given trend. They represent price levels where market makers intentionally break through support or resistance levels to trigger stop-loss orders from retail traders. )/K[8]/Pg 32 0 R/S/P>>
endobj

